{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17095","headline":"奉和武相公中秋锦楼翫月得来字 · 徐放","name":"奉和武相公中秋锦楼翫月得来字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉露中秋夜，金波碧落开。\n鹊惊初泛滥，鸿思共裴回。\n远月清光徧，高空爽气来。\n此时陪永望，更得上燕台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐放","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17095.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17095","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}